  "title": "Doctor Warns Collagen Supplements May Not Be the Skin Miracle Millions Expect",
  "summary": "Collagen supplements have become one of the biggest trends in the beauty and wellness world, with powders, capsules, drinks and gummies promising smoother, firmer and younger-looking skin. But before adding an expensive collagen product to your daily routine, experts say it is worth taking a closer look at what the science actually shows. A recent review of clinical research has raised questions about how confidently collagen supplements can be promoted as an answer to wrinkles and skin ageing.",
